--   Cylinder size = {length along X, diameter, diameter}; Ball size is uniform. weight = true only on "Head".
--   Part count (mirror counted twice) <= 14. Total length 2.6 (Wooden) -> 5.2 (Primal).
--   Nothing but "Bar"/"GripWrap" lies within |x| < 0.55 (hand zone). ForceField only on tier 15 (Aura shell).
--   Head height x depth: t1 0.68x0.68, t2 0.78x0.78, t3 0.88x0.88, t4 0.96x0.96, t5 1.06x1.06, t6 1.16x1.16, t7 1.22x1.22, t8 1.26x1.26, t9 1.3x1.3, t10 1.4x1.34, t11 1.4x1.4, t12 1.56x1.36, t13 1.66x1.36, t14 1.76x1.38, t15 1.86x1.3.
--   Max |z| extent stays <= 0.72 so a pair fits side by side on a 2.94-deep deck. Suggested pair z offset (+-) =
--     max |z| + 0.02: t1 0.38, t2 0.43, t3 0.5, t4 0.52, t5 0.6, t6 0.64, t7 0.65, t8 0.65, t9 0.69, t10 0.72, t11 0.74, t12 0.73, t13 0.73, t14 0.74, t15 0.74.
