--   Show it at scale 1 (full height up to 2.83 for Primal): a height cap of 1.25 would draw tier 15 smaller than tier 1.
--
-- GYM_STAND[i]: base = V70 CAMP GYM rack (Util.gymRack geometry), recoloured:
--   palette.wood  -> Decks (and the Sign board material)   palette.trim -> Uprights + Stringers + SignPosts (as Util.gymRack V82 does)
--   palette.stone -> Footings
--   palette.sign  -> Sign board                     palette.signText -> "CAMP GYM" text colour
--   materials.wood / trim / stone likewise.  light = optional glow colour of the current pair (PointLight / highlight).
--   extras: rack space (origin = floor midpoint, +X right, +Y up, +Z toward the player), PART format, Blocks/Balls only,
--   mirror = second copy at -x. Each stage lists its full set (not cumulative), <= 16 parts (mirror counted twice).
--   Keep-out respected by every extra: nothing above any deck inside |x| < 4.28 and |z| < 1.47 (current pair on the top deck,
--   optional smaller previous tiers on the lower decks), nothing in front of or around the sign (|x| < 1.45, y > 3.5, z < -1.3).
--   Thin trims on the deck front faces (z = 1.5) are allowed. Bounds: |x| <= 5, y <= 6, |z| <= 1.6.
--   Previews show the current pair on the top deck at x = 0, z = +-spacing, and previous tiers at ~0.6 scale on the lower decks.

